  "summary": "pypdf: Possible infinite loop in PdfWriter.find_outline_item",
  "details": "### Impact\n\nAn attacker who uses this vulnerability can craft a PDF which leads to an infinite loop. This requires calling `find_outline_item` on a `PdfWriter`.\n\n### Patches\n\nThis has been fixed in [pypdf==6.20.1](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/releases/tag/6.20.1).\n\n### Workarounds\n\nIf you cannot upgrade yet, consider applying the changes from PR [#4188](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/pull/4188).",
